# CORRECTNESS-E2E-01 F01: 3 LEFT 5 shows 53; STO x must store 53
# Two adjacent number nodes render as one numeral; the value computed must be
# the value displayed. Assert-only (no screenshot, no golden, no CI wiring).
wait 200
open_app Calculation
wait 60
set_angle_mode rad
key ac
key ac
key 3
key left
key 5
wait 3
key enter
wait 120
key sto
key x
wait 30
assert_app Calculation
assert_no_error
assert_variable x 53
